Subject: Suspected adverse reaction - Ceftriaxone 1 g injection
Date: Fri, 04 Sep 2026 10:15:00 +0530

Dear Team,

We are reporting a suspected adverse drug reaction. On 3rd September 2026 a 54-year-old
patient developed a generalised rash and difficulty in breathing within 10 minutes of
receiving Ceftriaxone for Injection IP 1 g (Batch CFT-2209, Exp. 07/2027). The patient was
treated and has recovered. 12 vials from the same batch remain in our pharmacy and have
been quarantined.

Please treat this as urgent and advise whether the batch should be recalled.

